            "value": "The PowerColor Red Devil RX 9070 Series is a gaming powerhouse built to dominate. With an enhanced triple fan cooling system (100mm each), 7 x 6φ heatpipes threading through its robust heatsink, and a premium copper plate ensuring direct contact with the GPU and VRAM, heat dissipation is lightning fast. Its premium phase VRM design, backed by high-quality PCBs, and DrMOS, guarantees unmatched overclocking, stability and cooling efficiency. The Red Devil is your ultimate companion for gaming victory—unleash its power and conquer every challenge."
