            "value": "The PowerColor Red Devil RX 6950 XT features triple fans (100mm x 90mm x 100mm), and a 320 mm cooler with 8 heatpipes. A large copper base directly touches the GPU, and assists the VRAMs to provide ultra-efficient heat transfer and dissipation. It is also equipped with a state-of-the-art PCB design utilizing a 14+2 phase VRM with DrMOS, high polymer solid capacitors, and three 8-pin PCI-E connectors to power the PowerColor RX 6950 XT Red Devil. / 5.Triple Fan The 2X 100mm and 1X 90mm optimized static pressure fan design provides more air flow and better cooling circulation. / ### Dominant Triple-Fan Cooler for Ultimate Gaming Experience"
