            "label": "Refroidissement et construction — description constructeur",
            "value": "The PowerColor 7700 XT Hellhound is meticulously crafted for durability and performance. Its metal-reinforced backplate adds a layer of protection and rigidity, while the Dual BIOS feature offers seamless adaptability between performance modes. Built on a high-quality 14-layer PCB, the card promises enhanced signal quality and longevity. / 1. Metal Reinforced Backplate / 2. Dual BIOS / 6. Optimum Heatpipe Arrangement / A set of 5 x 6φ nickel-plated copper heatpipes align closely above the PCB to more quickly and effectively transfer heat from the GPU and VRAM to the cooling array. / The metal backplate strengthens and protects the internal components from PCB bend, and a cut-out design on the back plate allows exhaust heat to properly flow through for heat-dissipation efficiency. / Hellhound RX 7700 XT features Dual BIOS built-in and a switch for easy swapping. -OC BIOS: A boosted mode that increases fan RPM to keep your card operating at a lower temperature to drive higher performance. -Silent BIOS: Focused on lower noise and fan longevity, a milder fan speed, trading fan speed and noise for moderate, but still controlled, temperatures while maintaining performance."
