            "label": "Refroidissement et construction — description constructeur",
            "value": "The PowerColor HELLHOUND RadeonTM RX 7600 XT is a testament to high-performance gaming, engineered with AMD's latest RDNATM3 architecture. This model is distinguished by its efficient cooling system, featuring a dual 100mm fan setup and four strategically placed nickel-plated heat pipes. Its power efficiency is further enhanced by a robust 7+2 phase VRM with SPS DrMOS and an 8+6 pin power connector, ensuring top-tier performance. The inclusion of high polymer solid capacitors and dual BIOS functionality underscores the HELLHOUND's commitment to both power and adaptability. / The increased array of horizontal aluminum fins helps the copper heatpipes collect and dissipate heat with maximum efficiency. / The card features a smooth nickel-plated copper base that makes direct contact with the GPU, significantly boosting the efficiency of heat dissipation and maintaining the card in an optimal cooling state. / The Hellhound RX 7600 XT is equipped with 4X6Φ nickel-plated copper heatpipes and an enlarged heatsink surface to provide lower temperature and better performance. / The metal backplate is extremely rigid to strengthen the card and prevent PCB bending, while the hollow area on it improves airflow."
