            "label": "Refroidissement et construction — description constructeur",
            "value": "1. Metal Reinforced Backplate / 2. Dual BIOS / 5. Optimum Heatpipe Arrangement / A set of 7 x 6φ nickel-plated copper heatpipes align closely above the PCB to more quickly and effectively transfer heat from the GPU and VRAM to the cooling array. / The metal backplate strengthens and protects the internal components from PCB bend, and a cut-out design on the back plate allows exhaust heat to properly flow through for heat-dissipation efficiency. / The PowerColor Red Devil comes with adjustable front, side, and backplate ARGB through the PowerColor Keystone control software. Lighting effects can be customized to your personal preference to match your system aesthetic or whatever the mood calls for. In addition, the Red Devil RGB can be synchronized with the motherboard using the ARGB cable included in the product, providing gamers an immersive and coordinated environment while gaming. / Red Devil graphics cards feature Dual BIOS built-in and a switch for easy swapping. -OC BIOS: A boosted mode that increases fan RPM to keep your card operating at a lower temperature to drive higher performance. -Silent BIOS: Focused on lower noise and fan longevity, a milder fan speed, trading fan speed and noise for moderate, but still controlled, temperatures while maintaining performance. / Every gamer is different and PowerColor wants to empower every gamer to pursue and celebrate their own identities. Sold seperately, Red Devil RX 7000 series owners will be able to easily change their graphics card backplate design with Devil Skins; it’s as easy as placing the Devil Skin onto their existing backplates using conveniently placed magnets - it's that simple and will hold the Devil Skin securely in place."
